---
source: crates/supdoc/tests/output/goldens.rs
expression: project.run(args).transcript()
---
$ supdoc config show
exit: 0
--- stdout
config     supdoc.config.toml
lockfile   supdoc.lock
include    **  (default)
exclude    (none)  (default)
line-endings  normalize  (default)
parse-timeout   10s  (default)
code-block-timeout 10s  (default)
code-block-build-timeout 10m  (default)
max-lock-size   16MiB  (default)
max-config-size 256KiB  (default)
max-ignore-size 256KiB  (default)
namespace  core -> src  (supdoc.config.toml)
--- stderr
